<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;c&gt;csv (in =&gt; $fh, out =&gt; undef, on_in =&gt; sub { ... });&lt;/c&gt; supports streaming and does not store in memory&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice, good to know!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;I found that [mod://PerlIO::via::gzip] *only* supports &lt;c&gt;open my $fh, ":via(gzip)", "file.gz";&lt;/c&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Too bad, but [doc://IO::Compress::Gzip] (core module) that I [id://11104402|showed] should support that AFAIK.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
